  "extract": "Tamsyn Elizabeth Muir is a New Zealand fantasy, science fiction, and horror author best known for The Locked Tomb, a science fantasy series of novels. Muir won the 2020 Locus Award for her first novel, Gideon the Ninth, and has been nominated for several other awards as well.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Tamsyn Elizabeth Muir</b> is a New Zealand fantasy, science fiction, and horror author best known for <i>The Locked Tomb</i>, a science fantasy series of novels. Muir won the 2020 Locus Award for her first novel, <i>Gideon the Ninth</i>, and has been nominated for several other awards as well.</p>"
